Intro text for each topic page, empty by default.
Override with a file of the same name in your includes directory, or with
topic-intro/<slug>.njk for a single topic
(e.g. topic-intro/accessibility.njk).

- {{ topic.label }} the topic, lowercased
- {{ topic.count }} how many decision records use this topic
